			"Message": "chore(Land): Update lychee config, turbo, and submodule with comprehensive changelog\n\nCoordinate monorepo-level updates:\n- Lychee: Rename include_ext→extensions, add Dependency to exclude_path, add 429 status code\n- Turbo: Update from 2.9.3→2.9.6, update schema URL to v2-9-6\n- Changelog: Populate comprehensive v2.1-v0.0 history following Keep a Changelog format\n- Element submodule: Synchronize all 13 components with latest changes including DevLog macro infrastructure, extension host protocol completion, language feature providers, and dependency updates\n\nThis brings the monorepo to latest Element state with full changelog documentation and modernized build tooling.",
